%SIXMD 1
# @?DPYVIEW - REPLAY A NATIVE TYPE-340 DISPLAY PROGRAM

## @?OPERANDS

### @?FILE
RAW DAIMOS WORD FILE CONTAINING A NATIVE TYPE-340 DISPLAY PROGRAM.

## DESCRIPTION

DPYVIEW REPLAYS FILE ON /DEV/DPY0 AT A NOMINAL 30 HZ. THE INPUT IS A RAW
SEQUENCE OF 36-BIT PDP-6 WORDS, EACH CONTAINING TWO 18-BIT TYPE-340
INSTRUCTIONS. DPYVIEW DOES NOT INTERPRET OR VALIDATE THE PROGRAM.

EACH FRAME STARTS FROM TYPE-340 RESET STATE. DPYVIEW ACCEPTS AT MOST 1024
WORDS. WHILE RAW FRAMES ARRIVE, RETAINED TERMINAL REFRESH IS SUPPRESSED BY A
SHORT LEASE; IF DPYVIEW STOPS, NORMAL TEXT REFRESH RESUMES AUTOMATICALLY.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - INTERRUPTED AFTER SUCCESSFUL DISPLAY
### @?1 - INVALID INPUT OR DISPLAY ERROR
